{title: Ek Tu Hi Bharosa}
{artist: Lata Mangeshkhar A R Rahman}
{key: Dm}

{c: Verse 1}
Ek tu [Dm]hi bharosa ek [Am]tu hi sahara,        Ek [Dm]tere jahan me nahi [Am]koi humara
[Dm]He Ishwar [Em]ya Allah,        [Dm]Yeh Pukar [A]sun le
[Dm]He Ishwa [A]ya Allah [Dm]He Data,        [F]Humse na [Gm]dekha jaaye
[C]Barbadi [F]yo ka sama,        [F]Ujadi hu [Gm]i basti me
[C]yeh tadapra [F]he Insaan,        [Bb]Nanhe jis [C]mo ke tukde
[A]liye khadi [Dm]ek maa,        [Bb]Barud [C]ke dhuae me
[A]tu hi bol jaaye kahan,        Ek tu [Dm]hi bharosa ek [Am]tu hi sahara
Ek [Dm]tere jahan me nahi [Am]koi humara,        [Dm]He Ishwar [Em]ya Allah
[Dm]Yeh Pukar [A]sun le,        [Dm]He Ishwa [A]ya Allah [Dm]He Data
[F]Nadan hai [Gm]hum to malik,        [C]Kyu di hu [F]me saza
[F]kya hai sa [Gm]bhi ke dil me,        [C]nafarat ka [F]zeher bhara
[Bb]Inhe phir se [C]yaad dila de,        [A]sabak wahi [Dm]pyar ka
[Bb]Ban jaaye [C]gulshan phir,        se [A]kato bhari duniya
Ek tu [Dm]hi bharosa ek [Am]tu hi sahara,        Ek [Dm]tere jahan me nahi [Am]koi humara
[Dm]He Ishwar [Em]ya Allah,        [Dm]Yeh Pukar [A]sun le
[Dm]He Ishwa [A]ya Allah [Dm]He Data
